OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of murder previously
OL,4,Ajailed for posing as vicar, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a woman
OL,7,Fwhose body was found in his freezer was
OL,8,Fpreviously jailed for fraud after
OL,9,Fposing as a vicar, a court has heard.
OL,11,FGeorge Gordon, 65, allegedly murdered
OL,12,Fhis friend Delia McInerney in April
OL,13,F2023, days before she was due to move
OL,14,Fto Portugal. He is also accused of
OL,15,Fkilling her five pet guinea pigs.
OL,17,FLiverpool Crown Court heard on Tuesday
OL,18,Fthat Gordon served a prison sentence
OL,19,Fbetween 2013 and 2015 after posing as a
OL,20,Fvicar.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
