OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of murder previously
OL,4,Ajailed for posing as vicar, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon has admitted killing McInerney
OL,7,Fand carrying out fraudulent financial
OL,8,Factivity after her death, but denies
OL,9,Fmurder and causing unnecessary
OL,10,Fsuffering to animals.
